  {
    "index": 3,
    "hash": "ZZv0JnLMobL4m9Nnxj68w267bfU=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:29:49.493Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "Critical Software is a Coimbra University spin-out and carries the strongest technical bench in the Portuguese set. The spin-out origin is a specific kind of signal: the firm was built around technical depth rather than around a delivery contract.\n\nThe problem is vintage. The figures behind that assessment are seven years old, dating from 2019, so the bench conclusion rests on a snapshot that predates whatever the firm has become since. A seven-year-old headcount and capability picture is thin ground for a ranking claim, particularly a claim that it leads its market.\n\nThe implied action is refresh rather than outreach. The lead sits at priority 4 needing an open-source screen, and the same pass should re-date the underlying figures; its stack was not researched.\n\n---\n\n## Leads sharing this finding (1)\n\n**4 \u00b7 needs OSS screen**\n- Critical Software (PT)\n\nVerbatim research text this claim was extracted from:\n\n> Coimbra University spin-out. Strongest technical bench in PT. Figures 7 years old (2019).",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-19T11:29:49.493063Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:29:49.493067Z"
    }
  },
